{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o211a","title":"曹操问徙淮南民蒋济谏不从","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-8256e6bc68fa12efae0c","label":"正文","text":"曹操问徙淮南民蒋济谏不从","evidence":["chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"问徙淮南民不从谏","evidence":["chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"谏百姓怀土","evidence":["chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42","source_order":[14,368,0],"order":3136}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0009","name":"蒋济","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-cf2177e3b88895201f42","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-d3210561135b256cd958","layer":"original","quote":"明年，使于谯，太祖问济曰：“昔孤与袁本初对官渡〖4〗，徙燕、白马民〖5〗。民不得走〖6〗，贼亦不敢抄。今欲徙淮南民，何如？”济对曰：“是时兵弱贼强，不徙必失之。自破袁绍，北拔柳城；南向江、汉，荆州交臂〖7〗：威震天下，民无他志。然百姓怀土，实不乐徙，惧必不安。”太祖不从。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":136,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
